Third-party data notice

This repository intentionally does NOT include the complete B1H zinc-finger
weight table derived from:

  Persikov AV, Wetzel JL, Rowland EF, Oakes BL, Xu DJ, Singh M, Noyes MB.
  A systematic survey of the Cys2His2 zinc finger DNA-binding landscape.
  Nucleic Acids Research 2015;43(3):1965-1984.
  doi:10.1093/nar/gku1395

That dataset is subject to its own terms; obtain it from the original authors
and place it at zfn_design/data/finger_library/finger_library_b1h.csv.
See zfn_design/data/finger_library/README.md.

The 3-record seed library shipped in zfn_design/data/finger_library_seed.csv is
derived from the public Zif268 (1AAY) structure and is provided for testing only.
